<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys back 2.8 mln shrs on market.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys back 2.8 mln shrs on market.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand said on Wednesday it had bought back a further 2.8 million of its own shares on market as part of its $1 billion share buy back.</p>
<p>The shares were bought at $6.50 to $6.54 against the closing price of $6.50.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
